-- src:l_17_1954_20210927:3 | Commencement [see endnotes]
@ref Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954 as consolidated for 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021 (src:l_17_1954_20210927:1-3)
GIVEN v IS A `Text of the Law`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 1: the text of the Law is a deposited text` v MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `no text before 28 March 2003` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the inferred text from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- The text has Articles 1(5) and 1(6): V1, and (by inference) the days from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018.
@ref Interpretation (Jersey) Law 1954, Article 1(5) and 1(6) (src:l_17_1954_20210927:9-10)
GIVEN v IS A `Text of the Law`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 1: the text of the Law has Articles 1(5) and 1(6)` v MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `the inferred text from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `V1, 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- Article 1: how sure an answer is: read from a deposited text, or inferred from the endnotes (the days from 28 March 2003 to 31 December 2018).
-- src:l_17_1954_20210927:154 | Interpretation (Amendment) (Jersey) Law 2003
-- src:l_17_1954_20210927:155 | L.16/2003
